    "title": "South Boston St. Patrick's Day Parade route changed. What to know",
    "text": "THINGS-TO-DOSouth Boston St. Patrick's Day Parade 2026: New route, family-friendly areaBailey AllenUSA TODAY NETWORK - New EnglandMarch 14, 2026, 5:08 a.m. ETRemember: The South Boston St. Patrick Day parade has a different route in 2026.The storied South Boston St. Patrick's Day Parade will bring its usual bright green Irish fanfare to the neighborhood – but this year, marchers and floats will follow a reversed route.Instead of beginning near the Broadway MBTA station, as it has in past years, the parade will kick off at Andrew Square and head in the other direction, to better honor the 250th anniversary of Evacuation Day, according to the Allied War Veterans Council of South Boston.",
